## 7. Isolation & Contamination Risks

### 7.1 Cross-Module Read Contamination
| Risk | Evidence | Severity |
|------|----------|----------|
| `app_settings.pms_policy_visible_roles` drives `AppSidebar` menu visibility for ALL roles | `policyVisibleRoles` consumed in `getStaticMenuItems` | Low (read-only) |
| `system_settings.menu_overrides_enabled` gates `AppSidebar` for ALL users | `overridesEnabled` consumed in `resolveGroupItems` | Low (read-only) |
| `system_settings.score_calculation_mode` affects ALL reviewer scorecards | Consumed in review hooks universally | Low (read-only) |

### 7.2 Cross-Module Write Contamination
| Risk | Evidence | Severity |
|------|----------|----------|
| MenuSettingTab can reorder/reparent items across module boundaries (e.g. Safety items under PMS groups) | `is_cross_app_movable` is `false` in catalog but parent changes are allowed within PMS | Medium (contained to PMS) |
| SafetySettings writes to `public.safety_settings` but lives in Safety module namespace | Correctly isolated by table | Low |

### 7.3 No Contamination (Good)
- `safety_drill.*` schema — completely isolated from `public.*`
- `system_settings` keys are namespaced by prefix (`score_`, `auto_`, `daily_`, `self_review_`, `menu_`, `increment_`, `email_`)
- `safety_settings` keys are namespaced by `safety_` prefix

