## 8. Gaps & Recommendations

| # | Gap | Impact | Proposed Fix |
|---|-----|--------|--------------|
| G1 | No audit trail for `system_settings` changes | Cannot trace who changed score calculation mode, rollover, etc. | Add `system_settings_audit` table (append-only, admin-selectable) |
| G2 | No audit trail for `app_settings` changes | Cannot trace branding/policy changes | Add `app_settings_audit` table or reuse `system_settings_audit` |
| G3 | No audit trail for `safety_settings` changes | Cannot trace Safety variable tuning | Add `safety_settings_audit` table |
| G4 | `safety_settings` is open-ended JSON with no registry | Typos in keys, invalid JSON types possible | Add `safety_settings_registry` (optional validated keys) or typed schema |
| G5 | `system_settings` values are loosely typed (string/number/boolean/object) | Parsing fragility in hooks (`replace(/^"|"$/g, '')`) | Migrate to strict JSONB with typed getters |

